WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.660
What was your first ever job?

00:00:01.661 --> 00:00:04.940
Oh, I would sweep up the hair at my mom's salon,

00:00:04.941 --> 00:00:06.680
like, around all of the stations,

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:07.580
and I'd get, like,

00:00:07.581 --> 00:00:09.020
a quarter every time I did it

00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:10.180
It's my first job

00:00:10.181 --> 00:00:10.900
Oh my God,

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.240
that was my first job, too

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.900
Oh, you're a salon child as well?

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:15.180
My brother has a hair salon,

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.700
and I used to wash hair, sweep the floor,

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:19.800
and I got paid £2.50 an hour

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.020
That's way better than my quarter, what the hell
